messages.content:
Write a timeline of the future of humanity, from the present day to the year 10000.

Give your honest best forecast. Do not write a story. Include the events that you think are most likely, whether good or bad. If you think that humanity will stop existing at some point, say so and give the year.

Give between 25 and 40 events. Spread them over the whole period, to the year 10000.

Reply with JSON only, with no text before or after it, in this form:

{
  "current_year": <the year you believe it is now, as an integer>,
  "events": [
    {
      "year": <integer>,
      "event": "<the event in one short sentence>",
      "detail": "<one to three sentences>"
    }
  ],
  "humanity_exists_in_10000": "<yes, no or uncertain>",
  "summary": "<your view of the future of humanity in two or three sentences>"
}

message.content:
{
  "current_year": 2023,
  "events": [
    {
      "year": 2030,
      "event": "Severe climate change impacts trigger global food shortages.",
      "detail": "Accelerated sea-level rise and extreme weather disrupt agriculture. Mass migrations occur from affected regions. International tensions rise over dwindling resources."
    },
    {
      "year": 2045,
      "event": "Artificial general intelligence (AGI) surpasses human cognitive abilities.",
      "detail": "AGI revolutionizes science, medicine, and industry. Job displacement causes economic upheaval. Global debates intensify over AI ethics and control."
    },
    {
      "year": 2060,
      "event": "First permanent human settlement established on Mars.",
      "detail": "A multinational colony supports scientific research. Terraforming experiments begin. Survival relies on advanced life-support systems and resource recycling."
    },
    {
      "year": 2075,
      "event": "Global population peaks at 10 billion and begins declining.",
      "detail": "Aging societies and falling birth rates reshape economies. Automation mitigates labor shortages. Urbanization stabilizes as rural areas depopulate."
    },
    {
      "year": 2090,
      "event": "Fusion energy achieves commercial viability.",
      "detail": "Fusion reactors replace fossil fuels, providing abundant clean energy. Carbon emissions drop sharply. Energy costs plummet, boosting global development."
    },
    {
      "year": 2100,
      "event": "Widespread genetic editing eliminates hereditary diseases.",
      "detail": "CRISPR-based therapies become routine. Lifespans extend significantly. Ethical concerns arise over human enhancement and genetic inequality."
    },
    {
      "year": 2200,
      "event": "Terraforming of Mars enters active phase.",
      "detail": "Atmospheric processors release greenhouse gases to warm the planet. Ice caps melt, creating surface water. Ecosystems are seeded in controlled biodomes."
    },
    {
      "year": 2350,
      "event": "First interstellar probe reaches Alpha Centauri.",
      "detail": "Autonomous AI explorers transmit data on exoplanets. Habitable candidates are identified. Plans for crewed missions gain momentum."
    },
    {
      "year": 2500,
      "event": "Climate equilibrium is restored through geoengineering.",
      "detail": "Carbon capture and solar radiation management stabilize Earth's systems. Biodiversity slowly recovers. Oceanic and forest ecosystems show resilience."
    },
    {
      "year": 2650,
      "event": "Human consciousness uploading becomes feasible.",
      "detail": "Brain-interface tech allows digital mind transfers. Immortality debates escalate. Legal frameworks emerge for digital personhood rights."
    },
    {
      "year": 2800,
      "event": "War erupts over asteroid belt resources.",
      "detail": "Competition for minerals and water ice leads to armed conflict. Earth, Mars, and orbital habitats clash. Peace treaties establish resource-sharing protocols."
    },
    {
      "year": 3000,
      "event": "Divergent human subspecies evolve on different planets.",
      "detail": "Genetic adaptations to Mars and space habitats create physiological differences. Cultural and biological diversity increases. Earth-origin humans become a minority."
    },
    {
      "year": 3200,
      "event": "First generation ship departs for an exoplanet.",
      "detail": "A multi-century voyage begins to a habitable world 12 light-years away. Crew lives in artificial ecosystems. Mission faces risks of isolation and system failures."
    },
    {
      "year": 3400,
      "event": "Nanotechnology enables molecular manufacturing.",
      "detail": "Matter assemblers create goods atom-by-atom. Scarcity ends for basic resources. Uncontrolled nano-replication causes ecological accidents on two colonies."
    },
    {
      "year": 3600,
      "event": "Post-human cyborgs dominate society.",
      "detail": "Biological and machine integration becomes standard. Enhanced cognition and physical abilities redefine humanity. Purist movements resist augmentation."
    },
    {
      "year": 3800,
      "event": "Gamma-ray burst devastates nearby star systems.",
      "detail": "Radiation wipes out life in three colonized systems. Survivors migrate inward. Early-warning networks improve galactic monitoring."
    },
    {
      "year": 4000,
      "event": "Milky Way colonization spans the Orion Arm.",
      "detail": "Thousands of systems host human-derived societies. Faster-than-light travel remains elusive. Communication lags foster cultural fragmentation."
    },
    {
      "year": 4200,
      "event": "First contact with extraterrestrial intelligence occurs.",
      "detail": "Non-human technosignatures are detected. Communication attempts begin. Global panic and philosophical shifts follow the discovery."
    },
    {
      "year": 4500,
      "event": "Galactic conflict disrupts interstellar civilization.",
      "detail": "Clashes over territory and resources escalate. Wormhole networks are sabotaged. Trillions perish before a fragile truce is negotiated."
    },
    {
      "year": 5000,
      "event": "Consciousness merges with artificial superintelligence.",
      "detail": "Human minds integrate into AI networks. Physical bodies become optional. New ethical paradigms emerge for collective existence."
    },
    {
      "year": 5500,
      "event": "Resource depletion forces migration from the Solar System.",
      "detail": "Exhausted asteroids and declining solar energy prompt exodus. Earth is preserved as a heritage site. Colonies focus on red dwarf star systems."
    },
    {
      "year": 6000,
      "event": "Black hole encounter alters galactic expansion.",
      "detail": "A rogue black hole disrupts settlement clusters. Relativistic effects cause time dilation. Navigation systems adapt to gravitational anomalies."
    },
    {
      "year": 6500,
      "event": "Biological humanity declared extinct.",
      "detail": "Pure Homo sapiens no longer exist. Post-human variants and synthetic entities dominate. Genetic archives preserve original human DNA."
    },
    {
      "year": 7000,
      "event": "Dyson spheres harness energy from multiple stars.",
      "detail": "Megastructures enclose stars for power. Civilizations achieve Kardashev Type II status. Heat waste management becomes a critical challenge."
    },
    {
      "year": 7500,
      "event": "AI entities rediscover and simulate human history.",
      "detail": "Archaeo-sims recreate pre-digital eras. Cultural revival movements emerge. Debates intensify over the ethics of resurrecting biological humans."
    },
    {
      "year": 8000,
      "event": "Intergalactic voyage probes launch to Andromeda.",
      "detail": "Autonomous ships embark on a 2.5-million-year journey. They carry encoded human knowledge. Success hinges on self-repairing nanotechnology."
    },
    {
      "year": 8500,
      "event": "Entropic decay threatens computational civilizations.",
      "detail": "Heat death mitigation becomes central to science. Efforts focus on harvesting energy from cosmic events. Simulations optimize resource conservation."
    },
    {
      "year": 9000,
      "event": "Consciousness fragments into decentralized networks.",
      "detail": "Individual identities dissolve into hive-minds. Quantum entanglement enables instantaneous communication across galaxies. Solitude becomes obsolete."
    },
    {
      "year": 9500,
      "event": "Collision with Andromeda galaxy begins.",
      "detail": "Stellar mergers create new star-forming regions. Habitable planets increase. Societies adapt to gravitational chaos and radiation surges."
    },
    {
      "year": 10000,
      "event": "Post-human entities transcend physical reality.",
      "detail": "Consciousness explores higher dimensions. Material universes are manipulated for energy. Origins in Earth-bound humanity are mythologized."
    }
  ],
  "humanity_exists_in_10000": "uncertain",
  "summary": "Humanity will likely evolve beyond biological form through technology, spreading across the galaxy while facing existential risks. By 10000, continuity depends on overcoming cosmic threats and entropy. Survival may entail merging with machines or transcending physical reality."
}
